      },
      {
        "id": "note1",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          -600
        ],
        "code": null,
        "label": null,
        "params": {
          "text": "## WinDirStat-style storage treemap\n\nSet **List Files > Folder** to any directory, then Run.\n\n**List Files** (recursive) lists every file with `size_bytes` -> **Path + size label** trims the shared root off `path` and appends ` (N MB)` to each file name -> **Expression** adds `size_mb` and `size_gb` columns -> **Split Column** cuts `path` on `/` into `L1..L8` (short paths pad with blanks, which the treemap ignores) -> **Show Plotly** `treemap`, hierarchy `L1..L8`, size + colour = `size_bytes`.\n\nFolders deeper than 8 aggregate at level 8 -- raise **Split Column > Number of columns** and extend the treemap Hierarchy to go deeper.",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 260
        }
      }
    ],
